  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">[CLOSED COMPONENT] CYED - EdTech Hub Contract Extension with ODI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity [CLOSED COMPONENT] CYED - EdTech Hub Contract Extension with ODI is a component of The EdTech Hub (Educational Technology Hub) - Robust research and innovation on digital, data and technology in education systems, providing global public research goods and direct country support for effective decision making on edtech. reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;1,299,999. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Education policy and administrative management, Educational research.</narrative>
  </description>
